Transformations
---------------
Extracted geographical aliases, address components, translations and dictionary
aliases; removed Japanese parenthetical district notes; grouped entities before
90/5/5 partitioning; added deterministic synthetic numeric variants; deduplicated
strings; weighted base strings by 1 and dictionary strings by 8. Counted Unicode
contexts up to order five, allocated storage among script groups, pruned tables
and quantized frequencies. Packed model fields with prefix/delta/varint coding
and DEFLATE. These transformations do not reproduce the source databases or
represent verified deliverable personal addresses.

